# ═══ .easignore — what the EAS build archive does NOT need ═══
#
# ⚠ .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for EAS uploads, so this file is a SUPERSET: every
#   .gitignore rule is reproduced below before anything new is added. Dropping one would
#   ship a secret to the build servers, which is the failure mode that matters here.
#
# Measured 2026-08-27: the archive was 289 MB and the app itself is 4.6 MB. docs/ (171 MB)
# and supabase/ (87 MB) are 258 MB of it, and a CLIENT build needs neither — no migration,
# suite, or design doc is compiled into the app. Every build was uploading them.

# ── reproduced from .gitignore (do not remove) ──
.DS_Store
node_modules/
.env
app/.env
_to_delete/
supabase/tests/.pgtest/

# Strava OAuth — client secret과 access/refresh 토큰이 들어간다.
# 파일이 생기기 **전에** 무시 규칙을 먼저 넣는다: 토큰이 한 번이라도 커밋되면 히스토리에서
# 지우는 것은 rewrite이고, 그 시점엔 이미 유출이다.
app/.strava-tokens.json
.strava-tokens.json

# 로컬 Supabase 컨테이너 산출물 — 실제 시크릿이 들어 있다 (git add -A 사고 방지)
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
app/supabase/

# 에이전트 툴링 산출물 (여러 세션이 각자 만든 것 — 저장소 내용이 아니다)
.gstack/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.agents/
.codex/
app/.agents/
app/.claude/
app/agent/
app/skills-lock.json
AGENTS.md

# Per-machine agent tooling — installed by Claude Code / Codex, not project source.
# Untracked-but-unignored is the dangerous middle: it shows up in every `git status`,
# which is how a `git add -A` sweeps it in (and why memory says never to run one here).
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
AGENTS.md
app/.agents/
app/.claude/
app/agent/
app/skills-lock.json

# Raw Overpass responses for the FEATURES harvest (34MB). The derived
# features.json is committed; these are regenerable by harvest-features.mjs and
# that harvest is complete, so nothing depends on them. The residential caches in
# _raw/ ARE kept: that harvest is 13/25 done and they make it resumable at zero cost.
docs/routes/geo/_rawf/

# Local Naver map key for the route bench — never commit a client ID.
docs/routes/strava/bench/config.js

# Higgsfield generated frames — picked keepers move to a curated dir; raw batches stay local
docs/campaigns/higgsfield-out/

# ── not needed by a client build ──
docs/
supabase/
prototype/
precision-director-install/
.claude/
.githooks/
.impeccable/
scripts/
TODOS.md
CLAUDE.md
DESIGN.md

# ⚠ app/scripts and app/test are KEPT — package.json's `test` script references them and
#   a build that cannot resolve its own package scripts is a new failure for no gain.
